{"id": "g5-001", "domain": "festival", "names": ["Stage", "Bar", "Dj", "Food1", "Food2", "Food3", "Tent"], "groups": {}, "text": "Planning an outdoor festival. First, the food stalls: bundle Food1, Food2 and Food3 into a group called Eats. Then make a group named Music out of Stage and Dj. The Bar should be near Eats. Put Music at the top and then Eats below Music. Tent can sit between Music and Eats. Duplicate Eats, we need two food courts. And is the Bar in a group? I don't think so.", "wires": [{"span": "bundle Food1, Food2 and Food3 into a group called Eats", "trigger": "bundle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Food1,Food2,Food3", "name": "Eats"}}, {"span": "make a group named Music out of Stage and Dj", "trigger": "make a group", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Stage,Dj", "name": "Music"}}, {"span": "The Bar should be near Eats", "trigger": "near", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bar", "position": "near", "anchor": "Eats"}}, {"span": "Put Music at the top", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Music", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Eats below Music", "trigger": "below", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Eats", "position": "below", "anchor": "Music"}}, {"span": "Tent can sit between Music and Eats", "trigger": "between", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Tent", "position": "between", "anchor": "Music,Eats"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Eats", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Eats"}}, {"span": "is the Bar in a group", "trigger": "in a group", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "groupOf", "target": "Bar"}}]}
{"id": "g5-002", "domain": "research lab", "names": ["Sample1", "Sample2", "Sample3", "Sample4", "Sample5", "Scope"], "groups": {}, "text": "uh so I have five samples and I'd like to bundle Sample1, Sample2, Sample3, Sample4 and Sample5 into one group called Samples. Then arrange Samples in a row and align Samples vertically? no, horizontally. The Scope goes above Samples. How many groups do we have, just the one right?", "wires": [{"span": "bundle Sample1, Sample2, Sample3, Sample4 and Sample5 into one group called Samples", "trigger": "bundle", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "group", "target": "Sample1,Sample2,Sample3,Sample4,Sample5", "name": "Samples"}}, {"span": "arrange Samples in a row", "trigger": "arrange", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Samples", "layout": "row"}}, {"span": "align Samples vertically? no, horizontally", "trigger": "align", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Samples", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"span": "The Scope goes above Samples", "trigger": "above", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Scope", "position": "above", "anchor": "Samples"}}, {"span": "How many groups do we have", "trigger": "How many groups", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count", "kind": "group"}}]}
